     2317               v-out-litres-tot2
     2318               )
     2319           .
     2320       output stream OutStr-html close.
     2321       output stream OutStr-html to value(v-file-name-rep-htm) append convert target 'UTF-8' .
     2322           put stream OutStr-html unformatted
     2323                           '<tr>
